      },
      "conversion": {
        "status": "unverified_with_static_semantic_difference",
        "findings": [
          "Upstream resnet.py uses TensorFlow SAME max-pooling; local ResNet50Stages uses symmetric padding=1.",
          "At a 112px stem output, TF SAME kernel3/stride2 pads 0 before and 1 after; local padding=1 pads both sides. Parameter shapes alone do not detect the spatial shift.",
          "Local last_stride=1 is a declared V8 dense-feature adaptation, not a literal upstream encoder.",
          "Tensor names, shard contents and numerical behavior still require the real archive."
        ]
      },
